WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.750
In the spring of 1915,

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:08.652
the Armenians of Van formed
two self-defense committees.

3
00:00:08.692 --> 00:00:13.816
About 1,500 fighters
had only some 300 modern rifles.

4
00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:16.946
From 20 April
the Ottoman guns opened,

5
00:00:16.986 --> 00:00:19.384
and for four weeks the shells fell.

6
00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:24.174
In mid-May, Armenian volunteers
and the Russian army rode in,

7
00:00:24.214 --> 00:00:26.069
and Van was relieved.

8
00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:29.798
Hold every wall
until the riders come.

